From 8a737d5096385e9f66fb85e01d5a824fee4bfbcf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:44:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 25/34] WP15: Skip unchanged iCal feeds

Integration with WP13: sync_all totals conflict. Kept WP15's counters; "changed" now means a feed whose calendar changed and was parsed again (WP15), and the scheduler's job run line (WP13) carries not_modified, unchanged and changed. tools/perf_report.py describes its iCal changed ratio accordingly.

Cross-WP fix for WP10: admin_ops.feeds_needing_attention now judges an ok feed by COALESCE(last_checked_at, last_sync_at) instead of last_sync_at, so a quiet calendar that WP15 skips is not listed as stale; the age column uses the same value. New test test_a_quiet_feed_checked_recently_is_not_stale in tests/test_admin_operations.py.

ADDED_COLUMNS: kept WP23's reservation.at_risk_mailed_at and its four guest.manual_* columns before the four ical_feed columns.
